    "localContent": "Daar a yembre,\n\nsoaamb ne katr kẽnga gɛl baoobo.\n\nB sẽn tar moogã faoodg-faoodgã,\n\nsoaamb wa tãsame:\n\n- Ad-m m me ne m gɛla!\n\nTɩ katr sok-a:\n\n- Yaa gɛl a wãna?\n\n- Yaa gɛl piig la a ye.\n\nTɩ katr yeel tɩ yaa yẽ pag a Pok n dʋʋg n yet tɩ yẽ wa wʋke.\n\nSoaamb yaool n miime tɩ yaa zĩrimbeed bal fass.\n\nLa a pãngã sẽn pa tõe katr yĩnga,\n\na yeel-a lame t'a wʋke,\n\ntɩ katr sɩd wʋk n sui a waoogẽ.\n\nB sẽn le tar gẽesg n tar gẽesgo,\n\nsoaamb le wa n yãa vak ne gɛla.\n\nT’a yeele:\n\n- Ad m vak ne gɛla.\n\nTɩ katr le soke:\n\n- Yaa gɛl a wãna?\n\n- Gɛl a yopoe.\n\n- Ãa !\n\nRẽ yaa m biig a Bãngzoees n dʋʋge.\n\nTɩ katr le wʋk rẽnda.\n\nSoaamb bãnga masã tɩ pa gũusi,\n\nyẽ pa na n kul ne gel-yend mengã ye.\n\nWoto,\n\na sã n yã vak ne gɛla,\n\na sokda katre:\n\n- M ba Katre!\n\nGɛl n be ka.\n\nHãnd pa yãmb yɛsb a Sepãar sẽn wa n dʋʋgã?\n\nKa rẽ bɩ:\n\n- Woto pa yãmb pʋgdb a Kayam sẽn bĩngã?\n\nLa Katr sẽn pa mi tɩ soaamb tũnugda gɛlã baoob n tʋʋd-a wã,\n\na wudgda fulll n tɩ wʋke,\n\nla a maande tɩ:\n\n- Fo sɩd bãngame.\n\nYaa m yɛsb a Sepãar n dʋʋge.\n\nYaa sɩda,\n\nwoto me yaa m pʋgdb a Kayam n bĩngi.\n\nB yiibã fãa talla woto,\n\ntɩ wĩndgã wa rat n tɩ lʋɩ.\n\nKatr waoogã yẽ pida pãb!\n\nYẽ gɛl baoob lokame,\n\nt’a kẽnd lʋʋ.\n\nlʋʋ,\n\nn kuiisẽ.\n\nSoaamb yẽ wa n yɛsa ne gel-yend bala.\n\nTɩ yẽ me lamsd n kuiisẽ.\n\nLa ãnd n pa mi soaamb ne a sɩlmã.\n\nA kẽndame la a tagsd yẽ sẽn na n maan to-to,\n\nn paam yalem-zaal a katr gɛlã n wãbe.\n\nA sẽn ta yirã,\n\na basame tɩ kaoos bilfu.\n\nA sẽn wa n tags tɩ masã t’a katr pagã rʋga gɛlã tɩ sek bɩɩbã,\n\na kɩtame tɩ yẽ meng pagã yi zakã noore,\n\nn yãbd woto:\n\n- wuyy,\n\nwuyy,\n\nGel-yend kʋ m sɩd yee.\n\nGel-yend kʋ m sɩd yee.\n\nKatr zakã rãmb sẽn wʋm yãbrã,\n\nrabeem yõk-b lame,\n\ntɩ katr yeel tɩ b vaag gɛlã tao,\n\nn lob rapoorã.\n\nB ra kell ba a ye rʋkẽ wã ye.\n\nTɩ bãmb me sã n wãbe,\n\nb na n kiime.\n\nSoaamb basame tɩ zĩigã sobg waa,\n\nt’a tɩ wʋk a bũmb n wa wãb ne a zak rãmba.\n\nMoos nong n yetame tɩ sẽn ka tar-a pãng segd n talla yam.",
