    "localContent": "Biig a ye n da be,\n\nt’a ba wã ne a ma wã ki,\n\nn bas-a t'a ya kɩɩba.\n\nA ba wã sẽn pa yɩ rakãagr yĩnga,\n\na pa bas-a ne ligdi,\n\na pa bas-a ne zaka,\n\na pa bas-a ne bãgre.\n\nRoor bal la biigã ra tara.\n\nA ra saada weoogã ne a roorã n lobd sʋya.\n\nDaar a yembre,\n\na yãa sʋʋr sẽn be kãoongẽ,\n\nt'a lobge,\n\ntɩ roorã pa kãoongẽ wã.\n\nKãoongã gõos yĩnga,\n\na ra pa tõe n yãk a roorã ye.\n\nA ra yɛsame n yɩɩnd woto:\n\nKãoongo!\n\nKãoongo!\n\nKõ-m m door wɛ!\n\nKãoongo!\n\nKãoongo!\n\nKõ-m m door wɛ!\n\nDoor ka m doore,\n\nDoor a naab a Wẽnd doore.\n\nNaab a Wẽnd ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nNaab a Wẽnd kʋʋ m ba,\n\nn kʋ m ma,\n\nN keeg roog n kõ-m tɩ m tar n lobd sʋy yee.\n\nTɩ kãoongã rɩk sʋʋr n kõ-a.\n\nA sẽn loog be,\n\na tɩ yãa noaag sẽn wũg a gɛlẽ.\n\nT’a rɩk a sʋʋrã n lobg tɩ noaagã rɩk n velemse.\n\nT’a le sɩng yɩɩla:\n\nNoaaga!\n\nNoaaga!\n\nKõ-m m sʋʋr wɛ!\n\nNoaaga!\n\nNoaaga!\n\nKõ-m m sʋʋr wɛ!\n\nSʋʋr ka m sʋʋre,\n\nsʋʋr a kãoong sʋʋre.\n\nKãoong ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nKãoong reeg m doore.\n\nDoor ka m doore,\n\nDoor a naab a Wẽnd doore.\n\nNaab a Wẽnd ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nNaab a Wẽnd kʋʋ m ba,\n\nn kʋ m ma,\n\nN keeg roor n kõ-m tɩ m tar n lobd sʋy yee.\n\nA sẽn yɩɩl woto,\n\nla noaagã sẽn yãk a gell a ye' n kõ-a.\n\nTɩ kɩɩbã le rɩk a sor n tar kẽna.\n\nA wa n tɩ mika sãy sẽn kut wãgse.\n\nBãng-y tɩ biigã rɩka gellã eb sẽn kõ-a wã n los zugdã bugme,\n\nn bas n zĩẽ.\n\nA sẽn bãng tɩ gellã rɩ zãng tẽme,\n\nla a sẽn le sɩng yɩɩla:\n\nSãya!\n\nSãya!\n\nKõ-m m gell wɛ!\n\nSãya!\n\nSãya!\n\nKõ-m m gell wɛ!\n\nGell ka m gelle,\n\nGell a noaag gelle.\n\nA noaag ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nA noaag reeg m sʋʋre.\n\nSʋʋr ka m sʋʋre,\n\nSʋʋr a kãoong sʋʋre.\n\nKãoong ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nKãoong reeg m doore.\n\nDoor ka m doore,\n\nDoor a naab a Wẽnd doore.\n\nNaab a Wẽnd ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nNaab a Wẽnd kʋʋ m ba,\n\nn kʋ m ma,\n\nN keeg roor n kõ-m tɩ m tar n lobd sʋy yee.\n\nTɩ sãyã yãk wãk a ye n kõ-a.\n\nA sẽn deeg wãkã,\n\nla a sẽn le rɩk a sore,\n\nn tutẽ.\n\nA tɩ mika na-pagb sẽn kood ne zẽemse.\n\nT’a rɩk a wãkã n kɩs-ba.\n\nNa-pagbã sẽn deeg kɩɩbã wãkã,\n\nsɩd ra sakda koobo.\n\nSɩd me,\n\nzẽeng kõn dɩk n mak ne wãk ye.\n\nPagbã wɩsga b meng n ko tɩ wãkã rɩ n sa.\n\nTɩ biigã le sɩng yɩɩla:\n\nNa-paga!\n\nNa-paga!\n\nKõ-m m wãk wɛ!\n\nNa-paga!\n\nNa-paga!\n\nKõ-m m wãk wɛ!\n\nWãk ka m wãka,\n\nWãk a sãy wãka.\n\nSãy ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nSãy reeg m gelle.\n\nGell ka m gelle,\n\nGell a noaag gelle.\n\nA noaag ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nA noaag reeg m sʋʋre.\n\nSʋʋr ka m sʋʋre,\n\nSʋʋr a kãoong sʋʋre.\n\nKãoong ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nKãoong reeg m doore.\n\nDoor ka m doore,\n\nDoor a naab a Wẽnd doore.\n\nNaab a Wẽnd ka ko-m zaalem,\n\nNaab a Wẽnd kʋʋ m ba,\n\nn kʋ m ma,\n\nN keeg roor n kõ-m tɩ m tar n lobg sʋy yee.\n\nNa-pagã baoo koodo,\n\nn kõ kɩɩbã.\n\nBiigã baoo zĩig n bĩng koodã,\n\nn yaool n yãk ka-zug a ye n yi n yeebdẽ.\n\nA sẽn gõodã,\n\na wa n tɩ yãnda Silmiig sẽn gũud a niisi,\n\nt’a rɩk ka-zugã n kõ Silmiigã naaf a ye.\n\nA sẽn bãng tɩ naafã wãb kaafã,\n\nla a sɩng yɩɩl yɛsa:\n\nSilmiiga!\n\nSilmiiga!\n\nKõ-m m kaaf wɛ!\n\nSilmiiga!\n\nSilmiiga!\n\nKõ-m m kaaf wɛ!\n\nKaaf ka m kaafo,\n\nKaaf a na-pag kaafo.\n\nNa-pag ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nNa-pag reeg m wãka.\n\nWãk ka m wãka,\n\nWãk a sãy wãka.\n\nSãy ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nSãy reeg m gelle.\n\nGell ka m gelle,\n\nGelɩ a noaag gelle.\n\nA noaag ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nA noaag reeg m sʋʋre.\n\nSʋʋr ka m sʋʋre,\n\nSʋʋr a kãoong sʋʋre.\n\nKãoong ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nKãoong reeg m doore.\n\nDoor ka m doore,\n\nDoor a naab a Wẽnd doore.\n\nNaab a Wẽnd ka kõ-m zaalem,\n\nNaab a Wẽnd kʋʋ m ba,\n\nn kʋ m ma,\n\nN keeg roor n kõ-m tɩ m tar n lobd sʋy yee.\n\nSilmiigã sẽn wʋm biigã yɩɩlã,\n\na kõ-a-la niisi.\n\nWẽnd ne a tõogã,\n\nbãng-y tɩ kɩɩbã koodã na-pagã sẽn kõ-a wã fɩɩgame,\n\ntɩ niisã Silmiigã sẽn kõ-a wã me fɩɩge,\n\nt’a lebg rakãagre.\n\nYaa woto tɩ nebã mi n yetẽ tɩ kɩɩb rɩt medga,\n\ntɩ Wẽnd pund bɩɩm.",
